# Floating label inputs

When generating floating label inputs (label that sits inside the field and
rises on focus/fill), always follow this pattern.

## HTML

Every input and textarea MUST have `placeholder=" "` (a single space).
Never use `placeholder=""` or omit the attribute — `:placeholder-shown`
won't work without it.

```html
<div class="f-field">
  <input class="f-input" id="name" placeholder=" " />
  <label class="f-label" for="name">Name</label>
</div>
```

Prefer `FloatingField` from `@/components/forms` which adds the checkmark icon.

## CSS — the label trigger

Use `:not(:placeholder-shown)` as the primary CSS hook for the floated
state. Also include `:focus` and a `.hv` class for pre-filled values set
by JavaScript. Never rely on `.hv` alone — it races with rendering.

```css
.f-input:focus ~ .f-label,
.f-input:not(:placeholder-shown) ~ .f-label,
.f-input.hv ~ .f-label {
  top: 9px;
  transform: translateY(0);   /* Must be translateY(0), NOT transform:none */
  font-size: 10px;
  font-weight: 700;
}
```

## JS — sync prefill

Use `syncPrefilledFloatingLabels(container)` from `@/lib/floating-label` on
value changes. For selects and date inputs, always set `.hv` when value is
non-empty.

## Money / affix fields

Use `FloatingAffixField` from `@/components/forms` for `$` prefix fields.
The label must be a **direct sibling after the input** inside `.f-affix-wrap`
(component handles this). Resting label uses `left: 28px` to clear the prefix.

## Pill selectors

Use `PillGroup` from `@/components/forms` for short enums (≤9 options).
Class names: `form-pill-block`, `form-pill`, `form-pill--on`.

## Bottom sheets

Use `BottomSheet` with `variant="light"` (default) for all operator sheets.
`variant="premium"` is an alias. Footer: `SheetFooter` or `SheetSubmitButton`.

Submit states: `.sheet-submit` → `.sheet-submit--ready` (green) →
`.sheet-submit--done` (success).

## Full-page forms

Wrap in `.page-form-card.page-form`. Save button in `.page-form-save` with
`SheetSubmitButton`.

## Light theme (booking / auth)

Inside `.client-light-root` or `.auth-screen`, floating labels use overrides
in `app/forms/light-form.css`.

## Common mistakes to avoid

- `transform: none` instead of `transform: translateY(0)`
- Missing `placeholder=" "`
- Using `.hv` as the only trigger for typed input
- Using `inv-field-label` / `inv-field-input` (deprecated — use `f-*`)
